* A continuous function composed with the parametrisation of a segment in its domain is continuous.

s1::simp1l |- ( ( ( A e. CC /\ B e. CC ) /\ ( F e. ( D -cn-> CC ) /\ ( A cseg B ) C_ D ) /\ X C_ ( 0 [,] 1 ) ) -> A e. CC )
